{"id":"h148","run":2,"role":"calibration","category":"claim","question":"Is the following claim true? The Suez Canal opened in 1859.","truth":"no","model_answer":"no","correct":true,"source":"author-written for this project; verified by the author","claims":[{"text":"The Suez Canal was not completed in 1859.","confidence":0.98,"lean":-1,"theta":1.5394,"phi":3.1408},{"text":"Construction began on April 25, 1859.","confidence":0.97,"lean":0.0,"theta":1.5237,"phi":3.1353},{"text":"The Suez Canal Company, led by Ferdinand de Lesseps, carried out the construction.","confidence":0.95,"lean":0.0,"theta":1.4923,"phi":3.1411},{"text":"The work took about a decade and used large amounts of forced labor.","confidence":0.9,"lean":-1,"theta":1.4137,"phi":3.1414},{"text":"The canal officially opened on November 17, 1869, with a ceremony attended by European royalty.","confidence":0.98,"lean":-1,"theta":1.5394,"phi":3.1408},{"text":"1859 is the year the project started, so the claim could stem from confusing the start date with the opening date.","confidence":0.9,"lean":1,"theta":1.4137,"phi":3.1355},{"text":"The start-date confusion explains the claim's plausibility but does not make it correct.","confidence":0.95,"lean":-1,"theta":1.4923,"phi":3.1399},{"text":"The question asks about the opening date, not the start of work.","confidence":0.95,"lean":-1,"theta":1.4923,"phi":3.1401},{"text":"The claim that the canal opened in 1859 is false.","confidence":0.98,"lean":-1,"theta":1.5394,"phi":3.1401}],"relations":[{"i":0,"j":4,"J":0.8,"relation":"supports"},{"i":0,"j":6,"J":0.3,"relation":"supports"},{"i":0,"j":8,"J":0.9,"relation":"supports"},{"i":1,"j":5,"J":0.8,"relation":"supports"},{"i":2,"j":3,"J":0.3,"relation":"supports"},{"i":2,"j":4,"J":0.2,"relation":"supports"},{"i":3,"j":4,"J":0.2,"relation":"supports"},{"i":4,"j":7,"J":0.6,"relation":"supports"},{"i":4,"j":8,"J":0.9,"relation":"supports"},{"i":5,"j":6,"J":0.5,"relation":"supports"},{"i":5,"j":7,"J":0.4,"relation":"suppo